{"id": 999182, "slug": "liquor-store-simulator-prologue", "name": "Liquor Store Simulator: Prologue", "name_original": "Liquor Store Simulator: Prologue", "description": "<p>At first, it won’t be easy—you’ll have to work the cash register yourself, accept deliveries, keep track of inventory, and maintain order in the sales area. But hard work and smart decisions will help you turn this modest store into a thriving business with a wide selection of products and satisfied customers.</p><p>In this free prologue, we invite you to explore some of the mechanics we’ve prepared for you. We’ve created a lot of content, but we’ve saved most of it for the full release, which is coming very soon! In the meantime, add the full version of <strong>Liquor Store Simulator</strong> to your wishlist and enjoy the prologue!</p><h3>Management</h3><p>Purchase goods, arrange store equipment as you see fit.</p><h3>Alcohol Licenses</h3><p>Buy alcohol licenses. This will give you access to more expensive and premium drinks.</p><h3>Customization</h3><p>Change the color of walls, ceilings, and floors. Make your store unique and unlike any other.</p><h3>Expansion</h3><p>Expand the sales area and storage space. This will allow you to offer your customers an even wider variety of products.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-03-07", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-04-26T07:22:16", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/305/3050a18c3d70cdcebf5b775ac633f004.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/546/546dce0619173bfb0dccc9e9d7724233.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 12, "added_by_status": {"owned": 10, "beaten": 1, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "r